    "title": "Two women wounded in east Baltimore shooting on Belair Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBFF STAFF ,\n22 hours ago BALTIMORE (WBFF) — Baltimore police shut down a portion of Belair Road following a shooting that left two women injured on Wednesday night. On Oct. 7, around 9:31 p.m., officers found a 20-year-old woman with a gunshot wound and a 22-year-old woman with a graze wound in the 3200 block of Belair Road. Read full article\n5",
